('78e5e3b6-2495-5080-a216-8fbfac5e72d1', 'CF_SC_01', 'A client called with a better offer the same afternoon I had promised my wife I would be at the school event. I turned it down, told my wife about it later, and felt no regret.', NULL, 85, 'christformed', NULL, 36, 138, '2026-10-02T12:08:36.000Z'),
('993ec748-0ce7-5b49-a5c2-809964b95154', 'ON_SC_01', 'A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my wife would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 69, 'growing', NULL, 30, 114, '2026-10-02T12:10:33.000Z'),
('7df9d758-83aa-54b6-aec1-fad2eb5d9c37', 'SL_SC_01', 'I stayed up late helping my wife with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 26, 124, '2026-10-02T12:12:40.000Z'),
('ad2a7134-4dbd-502f-a749-4c0bec5a573e', 'IN_SC_01', 'I show my wife the manageable version of how I am doing. The real version, the worry and the shame, stays with me.', NULL, 41, 'awakening', NULL, 23, 114, '2026-10-02T12:14:30.000Z'),
('e832be79-6446-5bf8-ac87-6ab97cab65f6', 'TC_SC_01', 'I mostly say what keeps the peace. What I actually think stays unsaid, and my wife is left guessing at it.', NULL, 25, 'unengaged', '["frequency_high_scenario_low"]', 21, 179, '2026-10-02T12:17:17.000Z'),
('3887fa58-d199-53d0-af0b-c3607b99c647', 'CR_SC_01', 'We argued about money and then barely spoke for days. It ended when my wife made tea one evening, and we never really discussed it.', NULL, 43, 'awakening', NULL, 25, 112, '2026-10-02T12:18:52.000Z'),
('659eadc7-abf1-5d3c-a9c1-019139ebb638', 'MH_SC_01', 'I was frustrated with my wife and still spoke respectfully. Later I told them I had been stressed and apologised for my tone.', NULL, 80, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 154, '2026-10-02T12:20:56.000Z'),
('fbb41f9f-1646-5ea1-a7a7-2ceab17b0c86', 'SV_SC_01', 'We both say we want some land and a growing family. I have not actually asked my wife where, or what they would give up to get there.', NULL, 50, 'growing', NULL, 28, 106, '2026-10-02T12:22:17.000Z'),
('61e5ffa6-04aa-5ade-a03d-f5c24b94a415', 'CF_SC_02', 'I had promised to help my wife''s family move on a Saturday when I was exhausted. I went, stayed until the end, and did not mention how tired I was.', NULL, 90, 'christformed', NULL, 30, 91, '2026-10-02T12:24:28.000Z'),
('f8c40b5b-5363-58fc-ade8-d6fe8bcaa5ae', 'ON_SC_02', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my wife about afterward, if I remember.', NULL, 68, 'growing', NULL, 22, 84, '2026-10-02T12:26:59.000Z'),
('60a04053-b804-5540-a68f-308f9588221a', 'SL_SC_02', 'I covered an expense for my wife''s family without being asked. It took me a few days to stop thinking about the amount.', NULL, 75, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 160, '2026-10-02T12:28:32.000Z'),
('8987b5d6-a318-50fe-aabc-28dc7537ebb5', 'IN_SC_02', 'I open up when asked directly. Left to myself, I would carry things alone, and my wife usually has to notice something is wrong first.', NULL, 50, 'growing', NULL, 25, 109, '2026-10-02T12:30:58.000Z'),
('380ee0cd-c2df-5043-a286-f61a70a7607d', 'TC_SC_02', 'I am honest when asked directly. When something is bothering me, it tends to come out as irritation rather than words.', NULL, 58, 'growing', NULL, 21, 75, '2026-10-02T12:32:50.000Z'),
('bfadab72-ba3c-5cdc-a960-73e03c5999f1', 'CR_SC_02', 'Fights tend to stop rather than get resolved. I go quiet, time passes, and the issue is still sitting there.', NULL, 42, 'awakening', NULL, 20, 80, '2026-10-02T12:35:49.000Z'),
('3e8753d3-9117-5155-a506-11cba6d539d0', 'MH_SC_02', 'I usually speak well of my wife. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private.', NULL, 80, 'rooted', NULL, 24, 178, '2026-10-02T12:37:44.000Z'),
('e2a804d2-b347-5a1a-a97f-8dfb1f00e4b2', 'SV_SC_02', 'Our plans are real but vague. I assume my wife pictures the same future, and I have never checked.', NULL, 55, 'growing', NULL, 19, 174, '2026-10-02T12:40:25.000Z'),
('de15cbd8-9af9-5cb4-a218-66c497e214da', 'CF_RE_01', 'I promised to call my wife every evening while I was travelling. I missed two nights, and I said so the next day instead of hoping it went unnoticed. I told my wife I would handle the tax paperwork by Friday. It got hard and I nearly let it go, but I finished it Sunday night and told them it was late.', NULL, 79, 'rooted', NULL, 62, 123, '2026-10-02T12:43:15.000Z'),
('a48592a5-ad64-5912-a64b-af9fa5ae78eb', 'ON_RE_01', 'I usually check with my wife before big purchases. Last month I bought something small without asking and told them straight away. We disagreed about taking on a new commitment. We talked it through and landed somewhere we both owned, though I had already half-decided.', NULL, 73, 'rooted', NULL, 45, 179, '2026-10-02T12:46:12.000Z'),
