('563d62c8-dd88-5703-a8eb-fe53a34ab809', 'SL_SC_02', 'I covered an expense for my husband''s family without being asked. It took me a few days to stop thinking about the amount.', NULL, 71, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 95, '2026-10-03T12:29:46.000Z'),
