('57fd837f-75fe-5118-a08e-caec199a733c', 'TC_SC_02', 'I am honest when asked directly. When something is bothering me, it tends to come out as irritation rather than words.', NULL, 50, 'growing', NULL, 21, 83, '2026-10-03T12:33:46.000Z'),
('be46de37-ed4a-5921-a60a-788e77f2f0db', 'CR_SC_02', 'I usually repair things eventually, after a stretch of coldness. Pride gets in the way more than I would like to admit.', NULL, 58, 'growing', NULL, 22, 79, '2026-10-03T12:36:40.000Z'),
('906d3b3e-48e3-576c-a3d8-9f1c5898a80a', 'MH_SC_02', 'I usually speak well of my husband. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private.', NULL, 82, 'rooted', NULL, 24, 112, '2026-10-03T12:38:22.000Z'),
