('c10f6f31-58de-5b32-ad8e-5aaf8cd5da1e', 'PM_CF_SC_01', 'I told my fiancée I would handle the tax paperwork by Friday. It got hard and I nearly let it go, but I finished it Sunday night and told them it was late.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 33, 164, '2026-10-05T12:09:58.000Z'),
('ba7621de-8322-5aef-af1c-0a90a100fc03', 'PM_ON_SC_01', 'We disagreed about taking on a new commitment. We talked it through and landed somewhere we both owned, though I had already half-decided.', NULL, 75, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 155, '2026-10-05T12:12:25.000Z'),
('d31dd2a0-220a-55fd-a739-023833386bd1', 'PM_SL_SC_01', 'I stayed up late helping my fiancée with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 26, 135, '2026-10-05T12:14:45.000Z'),
('3c0a0a29-677c-5fe8-aabc-fda1ce630892', 'PM_IN_SC_01', 'When I was struggling at work, I told my fiancée it was a bit slow. It was months before I admitted how bad it really was.', NULL, 50, 'growing', NULL, 26, 140, '2026-10-05T12:16:12.000Z'),
('96efb101-0cf6-5483-a055-69e078095d0a', 'PM_TC_SC_01', 'I told my fiancée something hard about a habit that was affecting us. I rehearsed it a little too much, but I said it clearly.', NULL, 83, 'rooted', NULL, 25, 98, '2026-10-05T12:19:11.000Z'),
('8a00749e-2053-575b-a878-74c7a8a56ae6', 'PM_CR_SC_01', 'We argued about money and then barely spoke for days. It ended when my fiancée made tea one evening, and we never really discussed it.', NULL, 45, 'awakening', NULL, 25, 149, '2026-10-05T12:20:41.000Z'),
