('0dbcdd3a-1d19-5469-aa3a-90781313b13b', 'PM_MH_RE_01', 'I usually speak well of my fiancée. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private. I was frustrated with my fiancée and still spoke respectfully. Later I told them I had been stressed and apologised for my tone.', NULL, 77, 'rooted', NULL, 47, 86, '2026-10-05T12:58:29.000Z'),
('559a7906-fd74-5fb7-ac40-fe4aac3caf5e', 'PM_SV_RE_01', 'Our plans are real but vague. I assume my fiancée pictures the same future, and I have never checked. We both say we want some land and a growing family. I have not actually asked my fiancée where, or what they would give up to get there.', NULL, 57, 'growing', NULL, 47, 150, '2026-10-05T13:00:44.000Z'),
('2da05393-6887-53ad-aa98-52ba44e4e01b', 'PM_X_RE_01', 'Amaka will probably say I am more certain about our future than I really am. I say yes quickly, and I have not always checked whether I mean it.', NULL, 64, 'growing', NULL, 29, 95, '2026-10-05T13:01:57.000Z')
) AS v(id, code, txt, scale, score, descr, flags, wc, rt, at)
