('0035b3f2-04f9-52cf-a7e9-4d033fe9fee4', 'PM_CF_SC_01', 'I said I would be home for dinner and a project ran over. I texted late, kept working, and told myself that my fiancé would understand.', NULL, 68, 'growing', NULL, 26, 98, '2026-10-06T12:09:36.000Z'),
('c7b1a87e-e77b-5513-a079-c830bf4870e7', 'PM_ON_SC_01', 'A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my fiancé would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 56, 'growing', NULL, 30, 91, '2026-10-06T12:12:06.000Z'),
('32110040-56e5-5be4-a773-e5375e7969fe', 'PM_SL_SC_01', 'I stayed up late helping my fiancé with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 83, 'rooted', NULL, 26, 166, '2026-10-06T12:13:51.000Z'),
('1014da75-78b4-55e0-a667-c13d2b817adf', 'PM_IN_SC_01', 'When I was struggling at work, I told my fiancé it was a bit slow. It was months before I admitted how bad it really was.', NULL, 66, 'growing', NULL, 26, 173, '2026-10-06T12:16:23.000Z'),
('3cc41374-d679-504b-a805-e402c4f93039', 'PM_TC_SC_01', 'I needed to tell my fiancé I was uncomfortable lending money to their cousin. I joked about it first and said it seriously only days later.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 26, 90, '2026-10-06T12:17:36.000Z'),
('1e150fab-9505-5f33-a97f-aee337a41a81', 'PM_CR_SC_01', 'We argued about plans. I stayed upset for a while but reached out that evening, and we talked it through.', NULL, 71, 'rooted', NULL, 20, 177, '2026-10-06T12:19:17.000Z'),
('c58ddf61-2793-5bc1-a457-be3eef91aeaf', 'PM_MH_SC_01', 'I was frustrated with my fiancé and still spoke respectfully. Later I told them I had been stressed and apologised for my tone.', NULL, 75, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 145, '2026-10-06T12:21:41.000Z'),
('8d659b26-b12d-5c4a-a1af-c0aef049a1ad', 'PM_SV_SC_01', 'We do not talk about where we are heading. Each of us makes decisions assuming the other will go along.', NULL, 49, 'awakening', NULL, 20, 166, '2026-10-06T12:23:38.000Z'),
('346807d7-b8a1-5267-adbe-b761e2e5bc5e', 'PM_CF_SC_02', 'I promised to call my fiancé every evening while I was travelling. I missed two nights, and I said so the next day instead of hoping it went unnoticed.', NULL, 74, 'rooted', NULL, 29, 128, '2026-10-06T12:25:49.000Z'),
('b1395ae5-933e-530c-a2db-2cfb21cbd049', 'PM_ON_SC_02', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my fiancé about afterward, if I remember.', NULL, 53, 'growing', NULL, 22, 116, '2026-10-06T12:28:06.000Z'),
('82ceab05-359f-5342-a8c4-2287b880186b', 'PM_SL_SC_02', 'I covered an expense for my fiancé''s family without being asked. It took me a few days to stop thinking about the amount.', NULL, 80, 'rooted', NULL, 23, 162, '2026-10-06T12:30:01.000Z'),
('d4d37a3b-6c06-54b4-ada2-1c8392487423', 'PM_IN_SC_02', 'I open up when asked directly. Left to myself, I would carry things alone, and my fiancé usually has to notice something is wrong first.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 25, 156, '2026-10-06T12:31:42.000Z'),
('4762ad67-8e3d-5b50-ae5a-65578cfe3d7c', 'PM_TC_SC_02', 'I am honest when asked directly. When something is bothering me, it tends to come out as irritation rather than words.', NULL, 56, 'growing', NULL, 21, 145, '2026-10-06T12:34:28.000Z'),
('b69f9cbf-1a21-507d-a366-46a161f5a1b2', 'PM_CR_SC_02', 'I usually repair things eventually, after a stretch of coldness. Pride gets in the way more than I would like to admit.', NULL, 69, 'growing', NULL, 22, 128, '2026-10-06T12:35:40.000Z'),
('dca33a20-697f-520f-a6aa-2e1e58dfa750', 'PM_MH_SC_02', 'I usually speak well of my fiancé. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private.', NULL, 70, 'rooted', NULL, 24, 89, '2026-10-06T12:37:50.000Z'),
('9cdd1535-e097-53e4-a9dd-d3a5f28c112a', 'PM_SV_SC_02', 'I have made plans about work and location without asking my fiancé, and I was surprised when they did not share my excitement.', NULL, 42, 'awakening', NULL, 23, 149, '2026-10-06T12:39:16.000Z'),
('67614cae-f13c-5b5a-a165-5d11658fd49e', 'PM_CF_RE_01', 'I promised to cut back on my phone in the evenings. It held for a week, then slowly slipped, and neither of us mentioned it. I said I would be home for dinner and a project ran over. I texted late, kept working, and told myself that my fiancé would understand.', NULL, 66, 'growing', NULL, 51, 161, '2026-10-06T12:41:18.000Z'),
('29c3eaf5-394b-5d10-af5b-ae2611f6d5aa', 'PM_ON_RE_01', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my fiancé about afterward, if I remember. A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my fiancé would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 55, 'growing', NULL, 52, 173, '2026-10-06T12:43:37.000Z'),
('b3f057dd-894b-5e52-a1cf-8d98c90e2f0f', 'PM_SL_RE_01', 'I covered an expense for my fiancé''s family without being asked. It took me a few days to stop thinking about the amount. I stayed up late helping my fiancé with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 73, 'rooted', NULL, 49, 83, '2026-10-06T12:46:28.000Z'),
('bcb82fba-2393-5496-a522-f95a80ec81ca', 'PM_IN_RE_01', 'I open up when asked directly. Left to myself, I would carry things alone, and my fiancé usually has to notice something is wrong first. When I was struggling at work, I told my fiancé it was a bit slow. It was months before I admitted how bad it really was.', NULL, 64, 'growing', NULL, 51, 165, '2026-10-06T12:49:10.000Z'),
('08c72143-5644-5f3c-aad8-02d304eb6e8f', 'PM_TC_RE_01', 'I am honest when asked directly. When something is bothering me, it tends to come out as irritation rather than words. I needed to tell my fiancé I was uncomfortable lending money to their cousin. I joked about it first and said it seriously only days later.', NULL, 52, 'growing', NULL, 47, 94, '2026-10-06T12:51:04.000Z'),
('061961da-23cf-571f-a19b-c37d4a8d6b15', 'PM_CR_RE_01', 'Most arguments get repaired. One recurring topic keeps lingering, and I know I avoid naming what is really behind it. We argued about plans. I stayed upset for a while but reached out that evening, and we talked it through.', NULL, 73, 'rooted', NULL, 40, 176, '2026-10-06T12:53:23.000Z'),
('c03482ee-3250-5177-a123-990bf69d2a10', 'PM_MH_RE_01', 'I usually speak well of my fiancé. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private. I was frustrated with my fiancé and still spoke respectfully. Later I told them I had been stressed and apologised for my tone.', NULL, 75, 'rooted', NULL, 47, 157, '2026-10-06T12:55:05.000Z'),
('81ac96f4-b62b-5154-abad-53c75157a8c2', 'PM_SV_RE_01', 'I have made plans about work and location without asking my fiancé, and I was surprised when they did not share my excitement. We do not talk about where we are heading. Each of us makes decisions assuming the other will go along.', NULL, 43, 'awakening', NULL, 43, 72, '2026-10-06T12:58:05.000Z'),
('d8e5c1d8-a99c-5d87-a455-1a4d2dbfe090', 'PM_X_RE_01', 'Tunde will probably rate us higher on talking about hard things. I tend to keep things smooth and then carry the rest quietly.', NULL, 68, 'growing', NULL, 23, 112, '2026-10-06T13:00:52.000Z')
