('21d3ae1e-89f2-5be5-a960-043b75b216af', 'PM_CF_SC_01', 'I said I would be home for dinner and a project ran over. I texted late, kept working, and told myself that my fiancée would understand.', NULL, 64, 'growing', NULL, 26, 87, '2026-10-09T12:09:54.000Z'),
('15339aff-b341-5ec4-ab37-175574020ad5', 'PM_ON_SC_01', 'A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my fiancée would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 52, 'growing', NULL, 30, 86, '2026-10-09T12:11:18.000Z'),
('678c9691-ea0a-5b59-acb5-95c161788f4a', 'PM_SL_SC_01', 'I stayed up late helping my fiancée with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 26, 161, '2026-10-09T12:14:02.000Z'),
('4c648619-3509-52bd-af7f-ed81772d028e', 'PM_IN_SC_01', 'I show my fiancée the manageable version of how I am doing. The real version, the worry and the shame, stays with me.', NULL, 45, 'awakening', NULL, 23, 80, '2026-10-09T12:15:13.000Z'),
('431f1b5e-d39c-5855-a89f-0f7ba5b49bd3', 'PM_TC_SC_01', 'I avoid hard topics by giving answers that are technically true. my fiancée often realises later that I did not say what I meant.', NULL, 48, 'awakening', NULL, 24, 86, '2026-10-09T12:17:37.000Z'),
('6e792b37-b052-5710-a3a3-4347350bacbd', 'PM_CR_SC_01', 'We argued about money and then barely spoke for days. It ended when my fiancée made tea one evening, and we never really discussed it.', NULL, 39, 'awakening', NULL, 25, 160, '2026-10-09T12:19:54.000Z'),
('34b95237-bdd0-5d0c-af30-787a52abe892', 'PM_MH_SC_01', 'I corrected how my fiancée pronounced a word in front of colleagues. They went quiet, and I knew it was a mistake but said nothing.', NULL, 66, 'growing', NULL, 25, 105, '2026-10-09T12:21:40.000Z'),
('47fd5412-208c-511c-a5f8-af05d1edc8ef', 'PM_SV_SC_01', 'We both say we want some land and a growing family. I have not actually asked my fiancée where, or what they would give up to get there.', NULL, 56, 'growing', NULL, 28, 165, '2026-10-09T12:23:47.000Z'),
('f4e5e264-3e02-555f-ad14-e3e51a6b7eb2', 'PM_CF_SC_02', 'I promised to cut back on my phone in the evenings. It held for a week, then slowly slipped, and neither of us mentioned it.', NULL, 67, 'growing', NULL, 25, 170, '2026-10-09T12:25:17.000Z'),
('bfc54716-4103-54a1-ab9b-28f25d08c7a7', 'PM_ON_SC_02', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my fiancée about afterward, if I remember.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 22, 147, '2026-10-09T12:27:41.000Z'),
('c2cab62f-dc20-5e28-ab9d-0d69377e94ed', 'PM_SL_SC_02', 'I do a lot for my fiancée, and I notice when it is not acknowledged. I try not to bring it up, and it comes out in small remarks.', NULL, 68, 'growing', NULL, 29, 73, '2026-10-09T12:30:39.000Z'),
('258cd73c-1402-5133-a749-23027bf3cd66', 'PM_IN_SC_02', 'When my fiancée tries to talk about something vulnerable, I tend to change the subject or find a task. I do not enjoy that about myself.', NULL, 48, 'awakening', NULL, 26, 154, '2026-10-09T12:33:36.000Z'),
('7b48e8c9-7c3e-54f6-a332-f3025976552a', 'PM_TC_SC_02', 'I am honest when asked directly. When something is bothering me, it tends to come out as irritation rather than words.', NULL, 54, 'growing', NULL, 21, 133, '2026-10-09T12:35:30.000Z'),
('3e7b11ad-5fe8-5247-a58d-54b06e27a422', 'PM_CR_SC_02', 'Fights tend to stop rather than get resolved. I go quiet, time passes, and the issue is still sitting there.', NULL, 44, 'awakening', NULL, 20, 137, '2026-10-09T12:37:12.000Z'),
('08dd471d-d535-590b-a741-baf79b69e8f2', 'PM_MH_SC_02', 'Respect comes easily when things are calm. Under pressure, my tone sharpens and I say things I would not say to a friend.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 23, 101, '2026-10-09T12:39:31.000Z'),
('5365a4b5-28b4-5759-a325-540d4a91bc62', 'PM_SV_SC_02', 'Our plans are real but vague. I assume my fiancée pictures the same future, and I have never checked.', NULL, 57, 'growing', NULL, 19, 131, '2026-10-09T12:42:15.000Z'),
('acd9e3ba-2efa-568a-a1a0-f72d5024b0a0', 'PM_CF_RE_01', 'I promised to call my fiancée every evening while I was travelling. I missed two nights, and I said so the next day instead of hoping it went unnoticed. I told my fiancée I would handle the tax paperwork by Friday. It got hard and I nearly let it go, but I finished it Sunday night and told them it was late.', NULL, 70, 'rooted', NULL, 62, 115, '2026-10-09T12:44:54.000Z'),
('e8a7af66-3cdd-548b-a15d-ed7bc74b4e0c', 'PM_ON_RE_01', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my fiancée about afterward, if I remember. A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my fiancée would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 52, 174, '2026-10-09T12:46:58.000Z'),
('643f002e-0e8b-5878-a0b1-0a2d112c4fbd', 'PM_SL_RE_01', 'I do a lot for my fiancée, and I notice when it is not acknowledged. I try not to bring it up, and it comes out in small remarks. I helped my fiancée with a move, but I mentioned afterward how much of my weekend it took. They heard it, and I wish I had not said it.', NULL, 65, 'growing', NULL, 58, 95, '2026-10-09T12:48:24.000Z'),
