('4930006c-d7c5-5189-ad2f-ebdae4516fc6', 'PM_TC_RE_01', 'I hint and sigh instead of saying what is wrong. I expect my fiancée to pick it up, and I am frustrated when they do not. I avoid hard topics by giving answers that are technically true. my fiancée often realises later that I did not say what I meant.', NULL, 45, 'awakening', NULL, 50, 78, '2026-10-09T12:51:26.000Z'),
