('cc4f9070-2439-57b0-a397-17bc79f6041f', 'PM_SV_RE_01', 'Our plans are real but vague. I assume my fiancée pictures the same future, and I have never checked. We both say we want some land and a growing family. I have not actually asked my fiancée where, or what they would give up to get there.', NULL, 60, 'growing', NULL, 47, 98, '2026-10-09T12:58:46.000Z'),
