('7d4a40e8-430e-5b84-ac00-4b412b57e6ff', 'RD_ON_SC_01', 'A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my brother would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 53, 'growing', NULL, 30, 78, '2026-10-07T12:07:34.000Z'),
('b188af2f-c719-54cd-addf-c077ed4221f2', 'RD_SL_SC_01', 'my brother was sick for a week. I took over everything, rearranged my work, and did not think of it as a sacrifice, only as what the week needed.', NULL, 85, 'christformed', NULL, 29, 131, '2026-10-07T12:09:05.000Z'),
('c70deaa3-0c26-5398-a472-0c472829184c', 'RD_IN_SC_01', 'When I was struggling at work, I told my brother it was a bit slow. It was months before I admitted how bad it really was.', NULL, 51, 'growing', NULL, 26, 168, '2026-10-07T12:11:59.000Z'),
('535812cc-c068-5e9e-ac1d-192a370a35be', 'RD_TC_SC_01', 'I needed to tell my brother I was uncomfortable lending money to their cousin. I joked about it first and said it seriously only days later.', NULL, 63, 'growing', NULL, 26, 97, '2026-10-07T12:13:19.000Z'),
('41d03eda-ce3d-5d73-a01f-1a4d97416a64', 'RD_CR_SC_01', 'We argued about money and then barely spoke for days. It ended when my brother made tea one evening, and we never really discussed it.', NULL, 39, 'awakening', NULL, 25, 117, '2026-10-07T12:16:12.000Z'),
('031744b0-984b-556a-a965-60b52ad9fdb3', 'RD_MH_SC_01', 'I corrected how my brother pronounced a word in front of colleagues. They went quiet, and I knew it was a mistake but said nothing.', NULL, 62, 'growing', NULL, 25, 158, '2026-10-07T12:18:53.000Z'),
('4e91786c-4b19-5e85-a0a0-b0a22a81a208', 'RD_SV_SC_01', 'I see myself married with a small family, working in something I believe in. I could not tell you where, or what I would earn, or how I would support my parents.', NULL, 52, 'growing', NULL, 32, 129, '2026-10-07T12:21:15.000Z'),
('9923d431-1940-583b-a611-65751b2059c0', 'RD_CF_RE_01', 'I promised to call my brother every evening while I was travelling. I missed two nights, and I said so the next day instead of hoping it went unnoticed. I told my brother I would handle the tax paperwork by Friday. It got hard and I nearly let it go, but I finished it Sunday night and told them it was late.', NULL, 78, 'rooted', NULL, 62, 171, '2026-10-07T12:22:53.000Z'),
('8f90fc9f-6ff5-525d-a89e-720178e29560', 'RD_ON_RE_01', 'We make the big calls together, but most daily choices I handle myself and tell my brother about afterward, if I remember. A decision about our weekend came up and I just made it, assuming my brother would not mind. They said it was fine, but I noticed I had not asked.', NULL, 61, 'growing', NULL, 52, 123, '2026-10-07T12:25:09.000Z'),
('bd0ee280-bfb1-5d8a-a8f2-84c36ff05990', 'RD_SL_RE_01', 'I covered an expense for my brother''s family without being asked. It took me a few days to stop thinking about the amount. I stayed up late helping my brother with a deadline that was not mine. I was tired the next day, but I would do it again.', NULL, 81, 'rooted', NULL, 49, 163, '2026-10-07T12:28:08.000Z'),
('64501317-3f10-533c-acf7-5c2e5a7f9b32', 'RD_IN_RE_01', 'I open up when asked directly. Left to myself, I would carry things alone, and my brother usually has to notice something is wrong first. When I was struggling at work, I told my brother it was a bit slow. It was months before I admitted how bad it really was.', NULL, 58, 'growing', NULL, 51, 140, '2026-10-07T12:29:47.000Z'),
('b85b0a56-7492-5af6-a09d-0ff1ad916bb0', 'RD_TC_RE_01', 'Usually I say what is true. Occasionally I soften it. Last week I caught myself doing it and went back to say the rest. I told my brother something hard about a habit that was affecting us. I rehearsed it a little too much, but I said it clearly.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 49, 117, '2026-10-07T12:31:22.000Z'),
('779fe965-35aa-5004-a87d-eb2062dc1a08', 'RD_CR_RE_01', 'Fights tend to stop rather than get resolved. I go quiet, time passes, and the issue is still sitting there. We argued about money and then barely spoke for days. It ended when my brother made tea one evening, and we never really discussed it.', NULL, 45, 'awakening', NULL, 45, 137, '2026-10-07T12:33:27.000Z'),
('e93a1166-c9b7-557d-ab60-ff7dc34628b9', 'RD_MH_RE_01', 'I usually speak well of my brother. Once I rolled my eyes in front of others and felt it immediately. I apologised in private. I was frustrated with my brother and still spoke respectfully. Later I told them I had been stressed and apologised for my tone.', NULL, 72, 'rooted', NULL, 47, 125, '2026-10-07T12:35:16.000Z'),
('04af0c7e-9e55-50b0-ab50-3b9809014224', 'RD_SV_RE_01', 'I avoid thinking seriously about my future because the answers feel risky. I let things drift and call it being flexible. I tell myself I will work out what I want once the right person appears. In the meantime I do not decide much about money, place or family.', NULL, 39, 'awakening', NULL, 49, 146, '2026-10-07T12:38:09.000Z')
) AS v(id, code, txt, scale, score, descr, flags, wc, rt, at)
JOIN questions q ON q.code = v.code;

